"The Maker of Narrow Ways is a rarely chosen knight skill, Stuart's choice."
"Its intended use is cross-dimensional exploration, which it cannot do at first."
"Its roots drink from connection, motion toward goals, precision and creation."
"It forms a way from one point to another, denying everything else the right to occupy that space."
"It can sever things but is not a severing skill; on a battlefield it strains authority more."
"Its spell preview sent a bean 27 paces through wood, stone and fruit, arriving unscratched."
"That preview spell takes over an hour and a half of chanting within a smoke-circled casting zone."
